["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/delegatedTo", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Agent is delegating an action to the Agent of the `to` Relationship (which shall be of type invokedBy), during a LifecycleScopeType period (e.g. the `to` invokedBy Relationship is being done on behalf of `from`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
